  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（煌。我需要你帶隊建立優勢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（你想組織一場突襲？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（我很擔憂現在的情況。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（現在，我們和雪怪都依靠各自的手法確定了博士和霜星的位置。你的法術很成功，他們現在很安全。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（然而......兩人的位置太接近了。只要能救出其中一個，另一個就會被一同救上來。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（有兩件事情是我們現在沒法確定的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（一是，會是誰先發掘出博士和霜星......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（另一個，就是霜星的態度了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（沒錯。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（如果是我們獲得先機，我們就必須立即制服霜星，但也要用她換取雪怪小隊的認同。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（這樣的話，我們不僅能避免戰鬥，也能獲得更深層的交流機會。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "（如果是對方先救出領袖......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "阿、阿米婭，心跳探測儀有反應了，我們確定了精確位置，深度還不確定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哎......等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎麼急急忙忙就衝出去了，啊喲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "一牽涉到博士的事，馬上就變得慌慌張張，甚至會把平常的習慣丟在一旁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "真不知道該說這是阿米婭她的缺點，還是她的特長......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你想，她剛才做的那些推測，根本不像是她平常會說的話。過於快狠準了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "還好，她沒有走到偷襲那步。這個該我們去做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不完全是。現在偷襲雪怪小隊，雪怪們一定殊死抵抗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我的目標是營救各位，而不是造成我們更大的傷亡。她沒放棄最優解的那部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......看來該道歉的是我。我傭兵思維太重了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你也沒直接動手不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒有被近在眼前的戰鬥勝利衝昏頭腦，而是堅守原本的戰術目標，這才是我信任的作為戰地指揮官的阿米婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我去雪怪那兒看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "這結構......太複雜了，我有點摸不著頭腦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "你給我描述一下，我來做圖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "啊？我中學第八年級的教材都沒念完，饒了我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "你上課時候又幹什麼去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "訓練去了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "不然你讓大熊試試？他不是有那種法術嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "他是念念詩寫寫文章那方面的，和你這種結構探測是兩回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "那你用算式表達試試，怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "欸，還挺不錯的，我數學還行，就這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "你有沒有感覺有點熱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "不是吧，我可是穿這麼厚也感覺得到大姊的源石能把我凍掉層皮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "你好啊，羅德島的貓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好意思，我只要一流汗，周圍就會變熱，然後我就會繼續流汗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "幸虧有你們，我感覺比平常涼快多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "你很緊張嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "有一點。畢竟我沒想到會和敵人共事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": ".....至少現在，可以不把我們當敵人。挖出來大姊以後，她說什麼我們照辦，但那是之後的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......你們和其他整合運動真的不太一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "又有幾個整合運動的成員是一樣的？你會覺得你和那隻小兔子是一樣類型的人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嚯。你說的還蠻對的，我們這兒也是什麼人都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "到哪都一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "至少你們肯聽我們說話，以前我們遇到的烏薩斯士兵，都是二話不說就射擊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "箭矢乒鈴乓啷地射得到處都是，之後就是打起來，到一方死光了才結束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "畢竟我們不是烏薩斯士兵，是製藥公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "製藥公司有你們這種裝備？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "現在形勢比較亂，大家都得有保護自己的手段，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "......如果能把這些打來打去的時間用來種地就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "如果能多種一季紅麥，就有至少半個聚落的感染者不用挨餓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "如果不是饑餓，他們也不會去那座小城，更不會被射殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "如果，哎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "別說了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "他還挺多愁善感的。不，我覺得烏薩斯人都有點多愁善感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "text": "怎麼在這偷懶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。該回去幹活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒事，你們忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不過你身上帶著的那個，香味真足啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "啊？這......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "text": "她在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒事，沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哎，有點饞啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "text": "哦......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "你，你看我幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "15:22 P.M.\n切爾諾伯格分城“14區”廢墟\n區塊地面\n挖掘作業三小時後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "阿米婭，收手吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "你的手指已經血流不止了......！別再用手挖了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "可我......我感受到情感了，就在這下面......就在這下面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "用工具的話，我感受不到......我必須用手指才摸得到那種細小的感覺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "阿米婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "已經很近了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（隕星......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "（可是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（讓她去吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "如果讓他們先找到的話......如果讓他們先找到的話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "沒事，你可以的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員D",
      "text": "要用法術？我，我不行啊，這個我真不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "除了大姊我們就沒人會這種類型的法術了啊？快點快點，只要把這兩邊的溫度變得不一樣就行，差距越大越好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員D",
      "text": "我就試試......失敗了可別怪我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員B",
      "text": "除了怪你，還能怪誰啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員C",
      "text": "別折騰他了，讓他集中精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "就是這裡，就是這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......牆體？我挖錯了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "對，只要打碎它，打碎它......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "可這裡坍塌的話......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我......挖錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
      "text": "打開了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "煌！隕星！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "做好準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你贏了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我會輸嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你沒有給我能贏的選項。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "text": "大姊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "text": "......這個人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪1號",
          "text": "這個人就是羅德島所說的博士吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "要殺要剮悉聽尊便！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
